      text: Provide Siebel Installers for DISA, EMS, and SAM This feature offers an enhanced installation experience for the Desktop Integrated Support Agent (DISA), the Siebel Email Marketing Server (EMS), and Siebel Approval Manager (SAM). The usage flow can be reused for both installation and configuration, ensuring a consistent user experience. Additionally, silent mode scripting is available for automated deployment. Customers installing or updating to the new DISA version will need to perform a reinstallation for security compliance, they can then update the application with Monthly Updates as required. Training on this feature is included in the Java 21 training on Oracle University. • Desktop Integration Siebel Agent Guide • Approval Manager Guide • Marketing Installation and Administration No
