      text: Siebel Upgrade Factory 2.0 Upgrade Factory 2.0 extends the capabilities of the original release of the Upgrade Factory, providing an easier experience for customers and partners who leverage Upgrade Factory for their Siebel Upgrades. New features include: • Performance Improvements–Both Schema and Data Migration scripts are executed in parallel, increasing the performance of the upgradeincluding Production. • Database Upgrade Guide No
    Current block: 26_6_update_logical_block_1918 (page 128)
      text: _Customers and partners who have used the techniques_ _implemented in Upgrade Factory 2.0 have seen a_ _reduction in production upgrade times taking 33% to as_ _low as 4% of the time previously taken on multi-_ _terabyte production databases._ • Production Upgrades–it is now possible to leverage the Upgrade Factory for non-Development upgrades. • Applicability–Upgrade Factory can now be used to upgrade environments from 7.8.2 or later. _Previously, only 8.0 and later were supported._ • Pre-Assessment Report–Summarizes critical conflicts and schema changes_before_performing the upgrade. • Observability & Monitoring–Provides for rapid detection and evaluation of upgrade-related issues. • Language Support–All 22 shipped languages are supported. Get training on this feature here: https://mylearn.oracle.com/ou/course/siebel-crm-2024- toi-siebel-crm-upgrade-factory/144117
