      text: Siebel Mobile – Automatic Data Synchronization This feature allows data synchronization for the mobile user to happen in the background automatically with minimal user intervention. This improves mobile user experience. Some of the salient features are: • System Administrator can set the frequency for auto-synchronization based on usage patterns. • Any data created in the offline application will get synchronized automatically as soon as the user goes online. • The user’s database gets synchronized automatically when the user is working online ensuring that user always have the latest data, whenever they go offline. • Automatic Data Synchronization feature comes as part of Siebel Mobile Disconnected. • Siebel Mobile Guide: Disconnected No
