      text: Category Upgrade & Updates Subcategory Upgrade Bug No 39249933 When _siebdevcli_ is run for Full Publish, for example during execution of the “UpgPhys” portion of an Upgrade, an error is thrown and the publish fails. The _siebdevcli.log_ will contain a “PASSWORD MISSING” error even though the password is provided on the command line. ``` 2021 2026-04-28 14:33:06 2026-04-28 14:33:06 +0000 00000008 001 003f 0001 09 siebdevcli 18088402 1 …/ses/siebsrvr/log/siebdevcli.log 26.5.0.0 [2026_05_PRE] DBCLog DBCLogError 1 0000000269f001d2:0 2026-04-28 14:33:06 SQLDriverConnect: DSN=siebel_DSN, UID=SADMIN ObjMgrLog Error 1 0000000269f001d2:0 2026-04-28 14:33:06 (clicon.cpp (3635)) SBL-DAT- 00446: You have entered an invalid set of logon parameters. Please type in your logon parameters again. DBCLog DBCLogError 1 0000000269f001d2:0 2026-04-28 14:33:06 SQLError: sqlstate 08001: [IBM][CLI Driver] SQL30082N Security processing failed with reason "3" ("PASSWORD MISSING"). SQLSTATE=08001 ``` ``` GenericLog GenericError 1 0000000269f001d2:0 2026-04-28 14:33:06 (secmgr.cpp (2878) err=4597538 sys=0) SBL-SEC-10018: You have entered an invalid set of logon parameters. Please type in your logon parameters again.(SBL-DAT-00446) [IBM][CLI Driver] SQL30082N Security processing failed with reason "3" ("PASSWORD MISSING"). SQLSTATE=08001 ``` ``` GenericLog GenericError 1 0000000269f001d2:0 2026-04-28 14:33:06 (secmgr.cpp (2934) err=4597527 sys=0) SBL-SEC-10007: The username or password you have entered is not correct. Enter your username and password again. ObjMgrSessionLog Error 1 0000000269f001d2:0 2026-04-28 14:33:06 (physmod.cpp (10125)) SBL- DAT-00569: The username or password you have entered is not correct. Enter your username and password again. ``` ``` ObjMgrSessionLog Error 1 0000000269f001d2:0 2026-04-28 14:33:06 (model.cpp (6577)) SBL- DAT-00569: The username or password you have entered is not correct. Enter your username and password again. ``` This occurs on AIX Siebel Server platforms only.
